guish GPU readiness, first/second/third window frames and worker/network waits. The acquisition/AppKit/bridge snapshots remain ready to capture the spontaneous failure without altering production deadlines. Keep 748f2d7 open. The wake livelock issue is tracked separately so its eventual closure will not imply that this issue is resolved.","files":null}]}